<div class="split-panels bf-studio"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Visual form builder</h2><p>Create reusable private form definitions without editing framework files.</p></div><span class="pill">STUDIO 1.1</span></div><div class="form-stack"><label class="bf-field"><span>Open a form</span><select aria-label="Saved forms" data-bf-form-open><option value="">Choose a saved form</option><?php foreach($forms as $slug):?><option value="<?= esc($slug) ?>" <?= $slug===$name?'selected':'' ?>><?= esc($slug) ?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><form action="/admin/forms/save" method="post" class="form-stack" data-bf-studio-form><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?= esc($csrf) ?>"><label class="bf-field"><span>Form identifier (slug)</span><input name="name" value="<?= esc($name) ?>" pattern="[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}" maxlength="64" required></label><label class="bf-field"><span>Form title</span><input data-bf-form-title value="<?= esc($schema['title']) ?>" maxlength="120" required></label><div data-bf-field-rows class="bf-studio-rows"></div><button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button" data-bf-add-field>+ Add field</button><input type="hidden" name="schema" data-bf-schema-output><div class="bf-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save form</button><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/admin/forms/export?name=<?= rawurlencode($name) ?>">Export JSON</a></div><p class="hint" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-bf-studio-status>Draft changes are not saved until you submit.</p></form><details><summary>Import or edit JSON definition</summary><label class="bf-field"><span>Validated JSON</span><textarea rows="8" data-bf-form-json></textarea></label><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bf-import-json>Apply JSON to editor</button></details></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Saved preview</h2><p>This server-rendered preview reflects the last saved definition.</p></div><span class="pill">READ ONLY</span></div><div class="form-stack"><?= $preview ?></div><p class="hint">Applications can render these definitions through FormBlueprint::render() and call validateSubmission() before business processing. Forms do not automatically create public submission endpoints.</p></section></div><textarea hidden data-bf-form-initial><?= esc(json_encode($schema,JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE|JSON_HEX_TAG|JSON_HEX_AMP|JSON_HEX_APOS|JSON_HEX_QUOT|JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR)) ?></textarea>
